@startuml SEQ_07_MELIHAT_JADWAL_PIKET
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-07: Melihat Jadwal Piket (View-Only)

actor       "Asisten / Dosen / Kadep" as Actor
boundary    "Browser"                as Browser
control     "JadwalPiketController"  as Controller
entity      "JadwalPiket Model"      as ModelJ
entity      "PeriodePiket Model"     as ModelP

== Melihat Jadwal Piket (Per Periode) ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Buka menu Jadwal Piket
Browser --> Actor : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/jadwal
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelP   : Query daftar periode piket
ModelP --> Controller  : Data periode
Controller -> ModelJ   : Query jadwal berdasarkan periode
ModelJ --> Controller  : Data jadwal piket
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman jadwal piket (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Jadwal piket per hari + filter periode (tanpa tombol Assign/Hapus)

== Melihat Jadwal Piket Asisten Tertentu ==

Actor   -> Browser     : Klik nama asisten, lihat jadwal
Browser --> Actor : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /piket/jadwal
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelJ   : Query jadwal asisten berdasarkan periode
ModelJ --> Controller  : Data jadwal asisten
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman jadwal asisten (view-only)
Browser --> Actor      : Jadwal piket asisten: hari, jam, laboratorium

@enduml